  "severity": "Important",
  "description": "The sos package contains a set of utilities that gather information from system hardware, logs, and configuration files. The information can then be used for diagnostic purposes and debugging.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* sos: sos: path traversal in sos clean tar extraction via unvalidated symlink/hardlink targets leads to arbitrary file write (CVE-2026-79655)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Hydra to GraphQL migration and sos upload [rhel-9.9.z] (JIRA:Rocky Linux-290949)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
